silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_05_bridge_to_presheaf_semantics_concrete_anchor_1#mittensyonedaprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensYonedaProfile is In section 'Bridge to Presheaf Semantics Paper' the bare symbol ForgeManifest anchors to MittensYonedaProfile: The Yoneda profile of Mittens: the family of Hom(-, Mittens) and Hom(Mittens, -) sets describing all typed approaches to and departures from Mittens — a representable functor." .
